<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21776" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">immurmŭro</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inm-</span></b> ), āre,
			v. n.
		inmurmuro, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to murmur in</i>, <i>at</i>, or <i>against</i> any thing (<b>poet.</b> and in post-class. prose): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ipsa jacet terraeque tremens immurmurat atrae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					6, 558</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">terrae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 11, 187</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">undis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 11, 567</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">silvis Auster,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 4, 261</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hastae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					5, 332</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tacita aure (Acestae),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 1, 532</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">undis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 11, 567</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">illa sibi introrsum et sub lingua immurmurat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pers. 2,
					9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">increpor a cunctis totumque immurmurat agmen,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					3, 646</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ipse publicato nobis, quod immurmurat,</span>”
				<i>whispers</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 6, 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cum saepe immurmurantes audierit ventos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 12, 16</span></i>
			.</div>
